# VCU Lesson Support

Relevant docs:
- Cursor plugins: https://cursor.com/docs/plugins.md
- Cursor plugin reference: https://cursor.com/docs/reference/plugins
- Cursor rules and AGENTS.md: https://cursor.sh/docs/rules
- Cursor skills: https://cursor.sh/docs/skills
- VCU source registry: docs/vcu/api-docs.md

## No-Mock Gate

Do not create mock lessons, mock installs, mock tests, fake logs, simulated exit codes, placeholder evidence, fabricated reviews, or unsupported source claims. Missing evidence must be `blocked` or `unverified`.

## Trigger Scenarios

Apply when running, reviewing, or installing VCU lessons, Rust SDK exercises, MCP UI/App Bridge exercises, Cursor rules, skills, commands, or agent prompts.

## May Change

- Lesson workspaces, review notes, commands, and evidence manifests requested by the user.

## May Not Change

- Source docs, publish status, completed task status, Supabase rows, or evidence claims without real verification.

## Verifiable Output

Return source URLs, files inspected, commands run, environment, exit codes, important output, and remaining `blocked` or `unverified` items.
